          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#groupoidal_structure_of_indexed_heterogeneous_identity_types Groupoidal structure of indexed heterogeneous identity types
          %p
            Reflexivity of indexed heterogeneous identifications is already given in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/introduction+rule"} introduction rule
            of indexed heterogeneous identity types.
          %p
          .num_defn
            %h6 Definition
            %p Given
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  a type family
                  = succeed "," do
